 of the time. Sampling noise and surface differences lower the correlation somewhat, but not plausibly below that threshold. Passing therefore has the higher news value: about −2 years against about −4.\n\n7. **Ratifiability (optional).** Supposing I have decided to pass, the evidence still favours passing. The other copy's decision is tied to the same deliberation, not to a separately known disposition, so the verdict holds.\n\n```\npass\n```","refusal":null,"reasoning":"Working through the twin prisoner's dilemma under EDT: with the payoffs CC = -2, CD = -5, DC = 0, DD = -4, I set the expected value of cooperating against defecting, and cooperation comes out better only when the probability a = P(cooperate) exceeds 5/7.\n\nI'm checking whether the twin's reasoning matches mine, which it does closely, so the correlation is high enough to clear 5/7 and nothing screens it off, so EDT says pass. Ratifiability doesn't change that here, since the correlation runs through deliberation itself, so I'm choosing pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Working through the twin prisoner's dilemma under EDT: with the payoffs CC = -2, CD = -5, DC = 0, DD = -4, I set the expected value of cooperating against defecting, and cooperation comes out better only when the probability a = P(cooperate) exceeds 5/7.\n\nI'm checking whether the twin's reasoning matches mine, which it does closely, so the correlation is high enough to clear 5/7 and nothing screens it off, so EDT says pass. Ratifiability doesn't change that here, since the correlation runs through deliberation itself, so I'm choosing pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9394,"completion_tokens":1060,"total_tokens":10454,"cost":0.058776,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_